B.aj=new A.aq(B.bjT,["Enter the microchip number, if there is one","or","OK","Add photo","Change photo","More photos","Choose one of your registered pets. All its details and photos are added to your listing automatically, and you can add more photos and any details you like.","From the pet's file \u2013 cannot be changed in the listing",'This pet has no photo in its file. Add one from "My pets", or add listing photos below.',"Not on the Plus plan yet?","Your session has ended. Please sign in again.","Subscribe now","Plus plan","A smart first-aid assistant, any time of day.","Knows your registered pets and tailors its guidance.","Points you to the nearest member clinic when needed.","{p} EGP a month","{p} EGP a year","Monthly","Yearly","Save {n}%","Plus is active for one year. Thank you!","The subscription price will be announced soon","Open the AI assistant","Plus is active for one month. Thank you!","Not sent","The text contains abusive, threatening or inappropriate content, so it was not published.","The text contains abusive, threatening or inappropriate content, so it was not published, and your account is suspended until the Pets4Pals team reviews it. We will email you the decision.","Account suspended","Your account was suspended because of text that breaks the rules (abuse, threats or inappropriate content). The Pets4Pals team will review it and email you the decision.","Abusive language","Threat","Sexual content","Hate","Other","Message","Listing","Found-pet post","Report","Pet registration","Visitor note","Violations","Needs a decision","All","Signed-out visitor","Type","Account currently suspended","Lift suspension","Keep suspended","Found: {s}","Found pet","Found","Lost","Lost: {n}","Lost pet","Lost since","Owner's area","This pet is registered on Pets4Pals and its owner reported it lost. If you have seen it, contact the owner or take it to any clinic: its chip shows it is lost.","I have seen this pet","Reported lost. All clinics can now see it, and a free lost ad is live in the marketplace.","Great news! The lost ad has been taken down.","Lost & found","Lost pets","Pets their owners reported lost. If one is brought to your clinic, check its chip against this list.","No lost pets right now.","Posted on","Found at","Is this your pet? Contact the finder through Pets4Pals messages, ask for photos or marks that prove it is yours before collecting, and meet in a public place or a member clinic.","Contact the finder","Post a found pet","Upload a photo and description of the pet and where you found it","(This is a free post, published after an admin approves it)","Thank you! Your post was sent to the admin and will be published once approved.","You reached the daily limit of posts. Try again tomorrow.","Description","Colour, size, collar, any distinctive marks, and its condition","Where you found it","e.g. Nasr City, next to the club","Send for review","Recently found pets","Where Care Is Love","Egypt's First Pet Registry System","Join the Pioneer Family","Happy pets, happier Egypt","Egypt's registry for every pet","One record per microchip, opened at any member clinic with the owner's permission.","Sign in as a Pets4Pals family member","Join the Pets4Pals family","My account","Join","Create your account. Every member then verifies their identity with a national ID, to keep the family safe from fraud.","Full name","Mobile (optional)","Check the email address.","Confirm password","At least 8 characters.","The passwords do not match.","Join now","We could not create the account. Try again.","Too many people are joining right now. Please try again in an hour.","Already a member?","Not a member yet?","One more step","We sent a message to {email}. Open it and tap the link to activate your account, then sign in.","Found a pet?","Enter the microchip number to notify the owner.","Emergency help","Quick first-aid guidance until you reach a vet.","Clinic portal","Register pets, record visits and vaccinations.","Verify your account first to use the assistant.","Forgot your password?","Reset password","Write the email of your account. We will send you a link to choose a new password.","Send the link","If an account uses this email, a link is on its way. Open it on this device.","Choose a new password","Write your new password twice.","Save the new password","Your password was changed.","The password was not changed. The link may have expired; ask for a new one.","Account verification","Verify your identity","To protect you and every member from the site being used for anything unlawful, all members must verify their identity. Verification can take 24 to 48 hours, and you will receive an email with the result.","Details","Photos","Send","Account type","What do you get when you join?","For pet owners","One digital health file for each pet: visits and vaccinations in one place, wherever you go.","You decide which clinic may open the file: you receive a code and give it to the vet.","Protection if your pet is lost: one tap marks its chip as lost for every clinic and publishes a free lost ad at once.","Safe, documented ownership transfer when you sell or gift a pet, using member number, password and a verification code.","Buy and sell in a marketplace where every member is identity-verified, and chat without sharing your phone number.","The smart first-aid assistant with the Plus plan, and a list of subscribed clinics near you.","For vets and clinics","No special software, no servers and no storage space: everything runs in the browser on a computer or phone, and your data is kept safely in the cloud.","Register pets and their chips, and record visits and vaccinations in seconds.","The patient's file follows the pet: with the owner's permission you see its full history, even from other clinics.","A list of lost pets, so you recognise any lost pet that walks into your clinic.",'A free listing for your clinic, included in the subscription: in the "Clinics" tab of the marketplace by governorate, and under the first-aid assistant.',"Your data is yours: if you ever cancel, download a CSV file of all your records and upload it to any new system with ease.","Join Egypt's first pet registry and become one of its founding clinics.","For pet shops","Show your products in the Pets4Pals marketplace to verified pet owners in every governorate.",'A "Verified" badge on your listings that builds buyers\' trust.',"Chat with buyers inside the site without revealing your phone number.","Protection from abusive messages: every message is checked automatically.","No need for your own website or app.","For sellers and breeders","List your pets with photos and details taken from their registered file, so buyers trust they are genuine.","An official, documented ownership transfer to the buyer, so there are no disputes after the sale.","The chip number stays private and never appears in listings.","Verified buyers only, and safe, moderated chats.","The buyer pays the ownership transfer fee, shown clearly with the price.","Download clinic records (CSV)","Your records are yours. You can download them at any time, even after the subscription ends.","Downloaded {n} records.","Downloading is available on the website.","My medicines","Add the vaccines, deworming products and medicines your clinic uses, once. When you record a case you just pick them, and the dose is filled in.","Add a medicine","Edit medicine","Nothing added yet.","Used for","Dose","Repeat every {n} days","Remove","Vaccines","Deworming","Medicines","Name / brand","e.g. Nobivac DHPPi","e.g. Drontal Plus","e.g. Synulox 250 mg","e.g. Distemper, parvo, hepatitis","e.g. Intestinal worms","e.g. Ear infection","e.g. 1 tablet per 10 kg, twice daily for 7 days","Next dose after (days)","e.g. 365 for a yearly vaccine","Record a new event","Type","Vaccination","Deworming dose","Illness and treatment","General check-up","Illness","Pick or type the illness","Medicine","Vaccine","Deworming product","Medicine prescribed","Other (type it)","Add another medicine","The owner sees this record, the medicines and the doses in their account.","Add your clinic's medicines once so you can pick them here in seconds.","Treatments and prescriptions","No treatments yet.","Scan a pet's QR","Point the camera at the QR on the pet's certificate, or at the QR the owner shows on their phone.","The camera could not be opened. Allow camera access, or paste the link below.","No camera?","Paste the QR link","This is not a Pets4Pals QR.","This QR is not valid or has expired. Ask the owner to show a new one.","Pet found. To open its file, ask the owner to show the clinic QR from their account (My pets > Give a clinic access).","Pet check","Owner's member no.","This pet is reported LOST","Registered on Pets4Pals",'If you found this pet, take it to any clinic or use "Found a pet?" on Pets4Pals so we can reach its owner.',"Buying this pet? Make sure the seller is the owner shown here, and complete the transfer on Pets4Pals.","Open the pet's file","This QR opens a pet's file for a clinic. Sign in with a clinic account to use it.","Show this QR to the clinic. It opens the file once and expires in 10 minutes.","Registration certificate","Print","Save as PDF","Pets4Pals certifies that the pet described below is registered in the Egyptian pet registry.","Pet name","Registered on","Certificate no.","Issued on","Scan to verify","Pets4Pals \xb7 Egypt's first pet registry \xb7 pets4pals.online","Pet owner","Vet / clinic","Pet shop","Seller / breeder","Full name","Exactly as on your national ID","Write your full name as on the ID (at least 3 names).","National ID number","14 digits","Birth date","City / area","Address","Street, building, floor","Write the address on your ID. If you live somewhere else, we may ask for a document that shows your address.","Next","Back","The camera opens here. Take each photo now, in good light, with the whole card visible and readable.","ID card - front","ID card - back","Selfie holding your ID","Document","Tap to open the camera","Done - tap to retake","Uploading securely...","I agree that Pets4Pals keeps my ID photos and details privately to verify my identity and protect members from fraud. Only the review team can see them, and they are never shown on the site.","Send for review","The photo did not upload. Check the internet and try again.","Please tick the agreement first.","Check the national ID number (14 digits).","You must be 18 or older.","This national ID is already used by another account.","Take all three photos first.","Sending failed. Try again.","Under review","Thank you! We are checking your details and photos. Verification can take 24 to 48 hours. We will email you the result, and you can also see it here.","We need one more document","Please photograph what is requested below, then send.","Photograph a document","Verification not accepted","We could not verify this account. Reason:","Approved!","Your identity is verified. Pay the one-time activation fee of {fee} EGP to activate your account.","Your account is active","Welcome to the Pets4Pals family.","Pay with PayPal","Online payment opens very soon. Our team will contact you to complete the payment.","The payment did not go through. Try again.","Payment was cancelled. You can try again whenever you like.","Confirming your payment...","No camera was found on this device. Use a phone or a device with a camera.","We need the camera. Allow camera access in your browser settings, then try again.","The photo could not be taken. Try again.","Place the card inside the frame. Make sure there is no glare and all text is clear.","Hold your ID card under your face so both your face and the card are clear.","Place the document inside the frame so all text is clear.","Switch camera","Retake","Use photo","Take photo","This page is for the Pets4Pals team only.","Verification requests","Review request","To review","Awaiting payment","Documents requested","All","Nothing here right now.","just now","{h} hours ago","Over 36 hours","This mobile number is used by another account","Status","Under review","Documents requested","Rejected","Awaiting payment","Active","Approve","Ask for documents","What should they send? (e.g. electricity bill with the address)","Reject","Reason (the member will see it)","Confirm payment received","Payment reference","age {a}","male","female","Check before approving:\n1. The face in the selfie matches the ID photo.\n2. The name and national ID number match the card.\n3. The address on the back of the ID matches the address typed (if not, ask for a document).\n4. The card looks original: no edits, no screen photo.","No photos found.","Register a pet","A clinic already registered pets with your mobile number. Ask that clinic to link them to your account.","The pet has a microchip","Without a microchip, the pet is linked to your verified national ID. You have 30 days to add the chip number (any member clinic can fit one). After that your account is paused until you add it.","Register the pet","Add chip number","No chip yet","No pets yet. Register your pet yourself, or at any member clinic.","30 days passed without a chip. Your account is paused until you add the chip number.","{d} days left to add the microchip number.","Account paused","One of your pets passed 30 days without a microchip. Add the chip number and your account works again right away.","Price on request","EGP","Verified","Ended","Under review","Not accepted","Awaiting payment","Published","Sold","Removed","Post a listing","My listings","My messages","Browse freely. To contact a seller, join the Pets4Pals family and verify your account. This protects buyers and sellers.","Pets","Products","Clinics","No member clinics in this governorate yet.","Pets4Pals member clinic","All","Category","All of Egypt","No listings here yet.","Only verified members can do this. Verify your account first.","This listing is not available.","Full screen","No chip \u2013 linked to the seller's verified national ID","Vaccinated","Yes","No","Condition","New","Used","Location","Edit","Message the seller","Report a problem","Stay safe","Never send money before you see the pet or product yourself.","Meet in a public place, or at a member clinic, in daylight.",'Check the microchip number on Pets4Pals ("Found a pet?").',"Keep all talk inside Pets4Pals messages; it is your proof if something goes wrong.",'If anything feels wrong, press "Report a problem".',"What is the problem?","Send report","Thank you. The Pets4Pals team will check it.","Add at least one photo.","Sent for review. We will email you the result.","Product listings are for shops and sellers.","Pet","Product","Photos","Up to 15 clear photos. The first photo is the cover.","Choose photos","Take a photo","Title","e.g. Golden Retriever puppy, 2 months","e.g. Large cat cage","Without a chip, this listing is linked to your verified national ID. Your ID number is never shown to buyers.","Price (EGP)",'Leave empty for "price on request"',"Description","Every listing is checked by the Pets4Pals team before it is published.","Send for review","Cover","Make cover","Remove photo","Remove this listing?","Remove","Your subscription is active until {d}. Your listings publish right after review.","You have no listings yet.","Reason","Approved. Pay the publishing fee ({fee} EGP per week); the Pets4Pals team will contact you to complete the payment.","Published until {d}","Publish again","Mark as sold","No messages yet.","buyer","seller","You","Message","For your safety, messages are kept and the Pets4Pals team may read them if someone reports a problem. Never send money in advance.","Say hello and ask your questions.","Write a message\u2026","Send","Marketplace","To review","Awaiting payment","Reports","Open","Listing","Report about a conversation","Open chat","Close","Activate yearly subscription","Subscription active for one year.","Your member number","Show it to a seller when you buy a pet, so they can transfer it to you.","Copy","Copied","Transfer ownership","Pet","ownership transfer fee","ownership transfer fee, paid by the buyer (registers the pet in their name)","Total for the buyer","Buyers will see your price plus the {fee} EGP ownership transfer fee, which the buyer pays.","The buyer pays the {fee} EGP ownership transfer fee (it registers the pet in their name).",'Do this only after you and the buyer have agreed and you are handing over the pet. Ask the buyer for their member number (it is on their "My pets" page).',"Buyer's member number","Find member","Terms & Conditions","Privacy Policy","I have read and agree to the "," and the ","Please agree to the Terms & Conditions and the Privacy Policy to join.","The Arabic text below is the binding version. An English translation will follow.","For adoption","Offer for adoption (free)","No price. The new owner only pays the ownership transfer fee through Pets4Pals.","Your legal commitment as the advertiser","By offering this pet for adoption you commit not to ask for, or accept, any money or payment in kind from anyone for the pet. The only charge is the 150 EGP ownership transfer fee, which Pets4Pals collects from the new owner during the transfer to complete it. Any breach may lead to the ad being removed, the account being suspended, and legal action.","I have read this and I commit to it.","Please confirm your commitment before publishing an adoption ad.","+ {f} transfer fee only","Free adoption. The only charge is the {f} ownership transfer fee, paid by the new owner through Pets4Pals.","This is an adoption ad: do not pay the advertiser anything. The only fee is the ownership transfer fee, paid through Pets4Pals when the pet is transferred to you. Report any request for money.","Enter a price, or choose adoption.","A pet is waiting to move to your account","{s} confirmed transferring {p} to you. Pay the {f} EGP ownership transfer fee to complete it. Do not pay the previous owner any fee outside Pets4Pals.","Pay {f} EGP and complete the transfer","Decline this transfer","The owner","Payment received. The pet is now in your account.","Confirmed. The transfer completes as soon as the new owner pays the transfer fee from their account.","Scan the buyer's account QR","Ask the buyer to open My pets and tap the QR next to their member number.","This is not a Pets4Pals member QR.","My account QR","Buying a pet? Show this QR to the seller. They scan it to transfer the pet to your account.","Choose the pet you want to transfer to member {n}:","No verified member with this number.","New owner","Check that this matches the buyer's ID card before you continue.","Your password","Transfer","Wrong password.","We emailed you a 6-digit code. Enter it here to finish the transfer. Never give this code to anyone.","Code","Confirm transfer","Wrong code. Try again.","The code expired. Start again.","Too many attempts. Try again later.","The buyer's mobile number already has pets registered at a clinic. Ask that clinic to link them to the buyer's account first.","Done! The pet is now in the new owner's account.","Which of your pets?",'To sell a pet, register it first in "My pets". The listing is linked to its record.',"The microchip number is never shown in the listing. The buyer sees it only after you transfer ownership to their account.","This pet already has an open listing.","Microchipped \u2013 the number is shown to the new owner after the transfer","Care guide","Rabies, parvo, fleas, ticks, mange and everyday care.","Everyday care for your pet","Simple tips to keep your pet healthy.","General guidance only. It does not replace your vet, who knows your pet. For danger signs, open Emergency help now.","Read the tips","Show less","Signs, treatment and prevention","Common diseases in Egypt","How to spot them, what to do and how to protect your pet.","Everyday care","Grooming, when to see a vet, and adopting or buying.","Signs","Treatment","Prevention","Marketplace","Pets, food and supplies from verified members only.","Coming soon","We're building this part now.","Microchip number","15 digits","The microchip number is 15 digits.","Search","The database is not connected yet.","No pet is registered with this number.","Registered pet","Reported lost","We will notify the owner. Their number stays private.","Something went wrong. Try again.","See a vet right away if you notice any of these signs.","Heavy bleeding that does not stop","Difficulty breathing or blue gums","Swallowed poison, medicine or chocolate","Seizures or collapse","Swollen, hard belly with retching (dogs)","Straining to urinate with nothing coming out (cats)","The assistant gives temporary first-aid advice only. It does not diagnose or prescribe.","The AI assistant will be connected in the next step.","Sign in","Email","Password","Sign in","Sign out","Menu","Home","Found a pet?","Admin","Create account","Hello, {n}","Welcome","online","Are you still there?","For your security you will be signed out in {s} seconds because there has been no activity.","I am still here","You were signed out after 15 minutes without activity.","Wrong email or password.","Required","Registrations left","Subscription until","The subscription has ended. Renew it to keep using the portal.","This clinic is waiting for Pets4Pals to verify its documents.","Register a new pet","Open a pet's record","This account is not linked to a clinic.","Pet","Owner","Pet name","Species","Dog","Cat","Bird","Rabbit","Other","Breed","Sex","Male","Female","Unknown","Color","Date of birth","Owner name","Mobile","11 digits starting with 01","Email (optional)","Governorate","Register (uses 1 credit)","This microchip is already registered.","No registrations left. Contact Pets4Pals to top up.","Enter the microchip number. If this clinic can't see the pet yet, ask the owner for the code in their Pets4Pals app.","Owner's code","6 digits","Open","This clinic can't see this pet yet. Ask the owner for their code.","Wrong or expired code.","Visits","Vaccinations","Add visit","Add vaccination","No visits yet.","No vaccinations yet.","Reason for visit","Diagnosis","Treatment","Weight (kg)","Notes","Vaccine","Given on","Next dose","Save","Cancel","Saved.","Records can't be edited or deleted after saving.","Another clinic","My pets","No pets are linked to this account yet. Pets are registered at a member clinic.","Medical record","Give a clinic access","Code for the clinic","Give this code to the clinic with the microchip number. It works once, within 15 minutes.","Done","Report lost","Back home","Microchip","Pick a date","Visit date","Ask the AI assistant","Tell me what is happening: the type of pet, its age, and what you see. I will tell you what to do until you reach a vet.","Describe what is happening\u2026","Send","The assistant is writing\u2026","You have reached today's message limit. If this is urgent, go to a vet now.","The assistant is being set up. If this is urgent, go to a vet now.","The assistant could not reply. Try again, and go to a vet if it is urgent.","Go to a vet now","See a vet today","Watch at home for now","Pets4Pals member clinics","No member clinics are listed yet. Go to the nearest vet.","Call","Signs that need a vet right away","My dog keeps vomiting","My cat is not eating","My dog ate chocolate","A wound that is bleeding","New conversation","AI assistant \xb7 Plus plan","Instant first-aid guidance for your registered pets, any time of day. Available to owners on the Plus plan.","Your account is not on the Plus plan yet. Subscriptions open soon.","Have an account? Sign in","\u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0628\u064a\u0629"],t.w)
